    classical vs SSL  p = 0.001
    SSL vs fusion     p = 0.000
    all differences REAL"]
    R3b["AGE-MATCHED cohort
    classical vs SSL  p = 0.718
    SSL vs fusion     p = 0.876
    all differences GONE"]

    T4["TEST 4
    change the task instead
    of the model"]
    R4["connected speech
    0.70 - 0.85 in all directions
    across 3 languages
    and it survives age matching"]

    T5["TEST 5
    what is worth clinically?"]
    R5["+1.3 extra cases
    per 1,000 screened
    vs screening everyone"]

    CONC["CONCLUSION
    Model choice is not a lever.
    Study design and task choice are."]

